    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgīsha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene Paulo nsese o ng'wa Kilisito Yesu, ūyo nitanwa kūbiza ntūng'wa, nguno nakomilwe kūlwa nīmo gwa Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja ng'wa Mulungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ījo ū Mulungu walī wajiisagīja kūfuma kale mu nzīla ya bahangi bakwe, mu shandīkwa sheela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī jene ī ng'hūlū ja Ng'wana wakwe, ūyo ū mu kabyalīlwe ka mu mīlī afumile mu lūganda lo ng'wa Daūdi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'wene Yesu Kilisito Seeba wise, ūyo kūlwa kūjūūka kwakwe kūfuma mu bafu, akoolechiwa mu būdūla bo ng'wa Moyo wa wela, gīkī alī Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū ng'wene ūyo mulī we twanukūlile shigongo na nīmo gwa būtūng'wa kūlwa mahanga gose; gīkī ū mu lina lyakwe banhū bose bazunye na babize bigwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we mulī bamò babo, abo Yesu Kilisito abitanile; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bose abo mulī Lumi, abo Mulungu amutogilwe, na wang'witana kūbiza beela:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo na mhola shibize hamò ning'we kūfuma kūlī Mulungu Sīswe, na kūfuma kūlī Seeba Yesu Kilisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'hūmbū ja ng'wa Paulo kūgeniha Lumi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwa kwandya nalīnūmba ū Mulungu wane mulī Yesu Kilisito kūlwa nguno ying'we bose pye, nguno ū kūzunya kwing'we kūkūjaga kūkumūchiwa hose pyī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūyo nakantūmamīlaga na moyo gwane gose mu nīmo gwa kūlomeela Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja Ng'wana wakwe, alī nkaanīji wane gīkī būlī gwa nakūng'wizūkagwa a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kūlomba kwane būlī gwa nakūlombaga gīkī, ūlū yūdūlīka ū mu shikū jenīji, napandīke ng'wanya gwa kūshimīza lūgendo lwawiza gīt'ūmo Mulungu atogelilwe, nize ūko mulī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nalī na ng'hūmbū ja kūmubona nang'winhe shakwinha sha kūfuma kūlī Moyo, mubize na nguzu ja kwīmīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya a bose tūguzuhiwe mu nzīla ya kūzunya, ū kwing'we nū kwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū badūgū bane, natogilwe ng'witegeleje gīkī, jakwīlaga ī ng'hangala ja kūmanūgema ū kwiza ūko mulī, nū kwene napandīke matwajo gīt'ūmo nakūpandīkīlaga kū mahanga gangī; alīyo nataalī nachaamilwe kūshisha nī lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī na būgasa kū banhū bose, babize Bayunani nūūlū ba mahanga gangī; babize ba masala nūūlū bachilū chilū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū nene ī ng'hūmbū jane, jilī kūmulomeela ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza na a bing'we abo mulī Lumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būdūla bo Ng'hūlū Jawiza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū nene natīko kūjibonela minala ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza, īkī ī joi hū jilī būdūla bo ng'wa Mulungu kūlwa kūmpīja ose ose ūyo ūzunya; kwandīja Bayudaya, na a ba mahanga a gangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mujo būkoolechiagwa būtūngīlīja bo ng'wa Mulungu, kwandīja mu kūzunya na kūkalīkīja mu kūzunya, gīt'ūmo gwandīkilwe gīkī, “Ū ntūngīlīja akūbiza mpanga kūlwa kūzunya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shibi sha banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu būkundūlīlilwe kūfuma ng'wigūlū kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji bose, na shibi sha banhū abo bakatūmamīlaga būbi wabo kwīfukīīla ī ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī mihayo ya ng'wa Mulungu īyo īmanīkile, īlīho yoolechiwe hape ū kū būtongi wabo, Mulungu ng'wenekīlī ayoolekije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī mihayo yakwe īyo ītī ya kūbonwa, gītī būdūla bokwe ū butashilaga, nū būmulungu bokwe; ī yenīyo nayo īdūgije kwitegelejiwa hape mu nzīla ya kūshibona ī shikolo īsho ashibeegije kūfuma ha kūseeng'wa kwa sī. Nose batī na nzīla ya kwibūūlīla! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nūūlū baamana ū Mulungu, nahene yaya ū kūnkūja gīkī alī Mulungu, nūūlū kūnūmba yaya. Alīyo hū babiza babūdigisīīla gete ū mu kiganikīle kabo, nū būchilū chilū bo mung'holò jabo būkongejaga kūbiza giiti! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kwikumīlīja kwabo gīkī balī na masala, hū bakongejaga kūbiza babbūūlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī likūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu ūyo atīko kūkenaagūka, bakalīgalūchaga kūbiza mu suso ya shiikolile sha banhū abo bakakenaagūkaga, na sha noni, na shiinū ja magūlū ane na ja kwigwesa ha sī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū kūlwa yose yenīyo, ū Mulungu abalekanīgije bashimīzīle mu būsoso wa kwikūmva kwang'holò jabo, bikale bagwikenaagūjaga ikūjo lya mibīlī yabo boi benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ng'wanya gwa kūshimīzīla mu ng'hana ya ng'wa Mulungu, būbiza ba kūshimīzīla mu būlomolomo, mu mihayo ya kūlamya shiseeng'wa na kūshitūmamīla, kūtinda kūnamya ū Nseemi, ūyo alī nkumīlījiwa wa welelo bose: Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
